2026-07-27T08:18:36.7434608Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:18:36.7502016Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:18:36.7753551Z i /tmp/RtmpEd81xZ/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:18:36.7754056Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:18:36.7754498Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:18:36.7755428Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:18:36.7755944Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:18:36.7756665Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:18:36.7757192Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:18:36.7757609Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:18:36.7860514Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:18:36.8350266Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:18:36.8532975Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
